4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5s9bVQj6de0Q7kNvwFKUz8k&_nc_oc=AdqIaAX0H7zOt5G9mSKqI-CsZyK4Ul9qIyROOad8qEOPcD5qa15GAPgOjg7iMrpDJ0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6zJDuH9OBGGRSavqFz0FPhAhJQOKV-15jvHTtF6WfIZw&oe=6A105454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P1JGX4F1oOcQ7kNvwEKk6Ds&_nc_oc=Adpp2FxwJUW8mmk89H95TeQt-vn3YwfOOm1jrt0ClEIP3ek--Rmix39dfFbb7G2daFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7vAKvZFekBJGWCB-J3nkCthqKMSOlVgduuqN1OLA_-og&oe=6A105932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t9_PK_Ui-90Q7kNvwHXqHh0&_nc_oc=AdruEyTmb_jTkzti7vXU8pIJZxiILsgeZ3vHngHKeB5li36dgLoidxxFw-ml1uaytwo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4l_YMwMLL68gmgWlAHCBsPUX6B9glLOonoLPNNAx7GSQ&oe=6A1066D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p